ptr_of_wii
==========

will help use wiimote as a point and click device. eventually maybe more.


plan
----
[X] read raw data from IR sensor device file
[X] parse the raw IR data
[-] build a visualizer to debug
[ ] do some math magic to point
[ ] test with visualizer
[ ] read raw data from wiimote device file
[ ] parse the raw event data
[ ] recognize key presses
[ ] test with visualizer
[ ] integrate with mouse events
